# distinfo is generated, never hand-edited: run `make makesum` in this
# directory once the v0.0.30 release tag exists, and commit the result.
#
# `make makesum` records, for this port:
#   - SHA256 (and SIZE) of bitty-0.0.30.tar.gz, the source tarball for the tag
#     fetched from MASTER_SITES, and
#   - one SHA256 entry per crate in CARGO_CRATES, stored under DISTDIR/rust/crates.
#
# Until that runs, `make fetch`/`make checksum` fail closed on the missing
# entries: intentional, because a checksum cannot be written before the tag
# content exists.
